stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> queued
    queued --> starting: a worker claims it
    starting --> running: first event
    starting --> failed: no credential
    running --> succeeded: result
    running --> failed: error or limit
    running --> cancelled: stopped
    succeeded --> [*]
    failed --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]
    note right of running
        A dropped socket, or a server
        restart, reattaches here.
        The run never leaves this state.
    end note
